/File:List_of_residents._(title_varies)_(IA_listofresidentst192217bost).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=197180882","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\nBoston (Mass.). Election Dept</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<p>...the alphabetical list begins in 1985, prior to that date the volumes are arranged by ward and precinct; the Microtext Dept. has the years 1861-1897, 1904, 1906, 1909 (ward 10, precinct 1, and ward 11, precinct 9), 1911-1930 available on call number: JS617.A5; the Elections Dept. in Boston City Hall may be able to provide 1996, 1997 and 1999...\n</p>\n<br>Subjects: List of Residents -- Massachusetts Boston; Voting Lists -- Massachusetts Boston</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"197149758":{"pageid":197149758,"ns":6,"title":"File:List of residents 20 years of age and over as of .. (IA listofresidents1964bost).pdf","index":40,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":31483292,"width":854,"height":1345,"pagecount":374,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/List_of_residents_20_years_of_age_and_over_as_of_.._%28IA_listofresidents1964bost%29.pdf/page1-500px-List_of_residents_20_years_of_age_and_over_as_of_.._%28IA_listofresidents1964bost%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":1512,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/List_of_residents_20_years_of_age_and_over_as_of_.._%28IA_listofresidents1964bost%29.pdf/page1-500px-List_of_residents_20_years_of_age_and_over_as_of_.._%28IA_listofresidents1964bost%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":1512},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.or